mir be discussed with her alone.\n\n6. Notes\n Lena's care costs and special-school transport: collect receipts for Anlage Kind.\nFrau Weißmüller-Öztürk reduced her hours in September 2024 because of\nthis.\n Herr Dr. Weißmüller received a letter from the tax office about undeclared\ninterest on a Swiss account, IBAN CH90 4330 6913 7671 3015 3, balance about\nCHF 61'000. He says it was his late mother's. Voluntary disclosure to be\ndiscussed in person only — nothing by email.", "kind": "PDF", "detail": "2 pages · 370 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Sabine Hölzl", "Jürgen Weißmüller", "Aylin Weißmüller-Öztürk", "Lena Weißmüller", "Lena", "Frau Weißmüller-Öztürk", "Herr Dr. Weißmüller"], "companies": ["Steuerkanzlei Hölzl & Partner mbB", "Weißmüller Ingenieurbüro", "Isartal Sparkasse", "Swiss"]}, "topics": {"places": ["München", "Regensburg", "Izmir"], "health": ["CHF 61'000"], "sensitive": ["German citizen", "Turkish passport", "left 2011", "Islamic religious practice", "lump sum under § 33b EStG"], "names": ["Jürgen", "Aylin", "Lena", "Herr Dr. Weißmüller"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 77, "modelMs": 29308.80000000447, "topicMs": 34591.5, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 33, "text": "Steuerkanzlei Hölzl & Partner mbB", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Steuerkanzlei Hölzl & Partner mbB"}, {"start": 34, "end": 50, "text": "Rumfordstraße 21", "kind": "street", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Rumfordstraße 21"}, {"start": 58, "end": 65, "text": "München", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Finanzamt München"}, {"start": 73, "end": 88, "text": "+49 89 5550 142", "kind": "phone